	<section_number>29.1-511</section_number>
	<catch_line>Open season on nuisance species</catch_line>
	<text>
		There shall be a continuous open season for killing nuisance species of wild birds and wild animals as defined in § 29.1-100.
	</text>
	<history>Code 1950, § 29-133; 1958, c. 165; 1974, c. 302; 1987, c. 488.</history>
